"Steep Snowdrift");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Warm, Cozy Drain");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Boggy Bog");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Turbid Marshland");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Famous Fortress");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Snappy Ocean");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Choppy Port");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Mighty Harbor");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Dingy Morass");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Spiraling Sewer");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Bungled Jungle");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Banal Canal");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Fragrant Field");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Rough Company");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Gloomy Growth");_fZ1(global._Te3,
"Galactic Spaceport");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Delightful Stink");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Feathery Peak");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Rumbly Rainforest");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Addled Mud");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Breezy Woods");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Heavenly Platform");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Dizzy Duct");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Perilous Plain");_fZ1(global._Te3,"Weary Wharf");global._NK3=_DU1();_fZ1(global._NK3," .");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy new year, Dad!|Ugh, a whole new year. I was just getting used to the old one.|This one's going to be even worse!|Hooray!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Life's pretty good, huh Dad?|It is, although I'd prefer it if my kids didn't go missing all the time.|But going missing is my hobby. I'm really good at it!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Where's the sandwiches?|Huh?|For the picnic!|We're having a picnic?|No, because you didn't bring the sandwiches.|I didn't know I was supposed to!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad! Got any good jokes?|No, sorry, I can't think of any.|Me neither.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Welcome to the party, Dad!|Oh, uh thanks! What are we celebrating?|Friendship!|But... I'm the only one here?|All my other friends were eaten by bears.|Oh.|Hooray for friendship!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Sometimes the trees whisper to me!|What do they say?|\"Buy now and save!\".|Really?!|Yeah! And \"Only 10 easy payments of $99.99\"!|I think I need to stop letting you watch late night TV.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad! I'm on the run from the law!|Really?! What happened?|I was framed for a crime I didn't commit!|Oh no!|I was also framed for some other crimes that I actually DID commit.|I don't know if that counts as being framed.|I just love doing crimes.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Yeehaw! I've decided to become a cowboy!|Uh, OK. Cool.|Half boy, half cow!|That's not what a cowboy is.|Mooo! Who wants some milk! Mooo! Yeehaw!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's so cold! I'm a frozen vegetable.|You'll be OK.|I'm snap frozen to lock in the freshness!|Huh?|Straight from the farm to your freezer!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Someone needs to sweep up around here.|I think this place is abandoned.|Well they could have had the decency to sweep up before they abandoned it.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I found a glowing crystal skull!|Uh, you should probably put that back.|I put it in a sack with the glowing crystal femur, glowing crystal ribs and all the other glowing crystal bones.|I'm not getting out of here uncursed, am I?|Nope! Your best bet is to collect enough different curses that they even each other out.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, have you come to take me home?|Yes, I've been very worried about you!|I've just been here eating beans! Tons and tons of beans!|Oh, uh, neat.|I'm extremely gassy!|Maybe you can just stay here.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm coming back here with a chainsaw!|What?! Why?|I'm going to cut down some trees and make a log cabin.|I think your lack of arms might make using chainsaw a bit difficult.|It didn't stop the frontiersmen of the past and it won't stop me either!|I'm... pretty sure they had arms.|You don't know that for sure!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy National Hot Pastrami Sandwich Day, Dad!|My favorite holiday! Nothing but Hot Pastrami Sandwiches, all day long!|But I want to eat peanut butter.|Shh!! You'll be arrested! Only pastrami, you know the rules.|Oh, right, sorry. Mmm. Pastrami. Yummy.|Good girl.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Why is sailing limited to the sea?|It's not! Land yachting is a thing that exists.|Oh wow, awesome! What about land harpooning?|Huh?|There's this rude guy at the bank and I'd like to harpoon him.|I, uh, think you'll have to go out to sea for that one buddy.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think there's any dinosaur bones at the bottom of the swamp?|Could be, but I don't want to go down there and find out.|We just need to pull them to the surface somehow. Maybe with a... dinosaur... magnet?|That's not a thing that exists.|Not yet!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, is the world ending?|Probably not, but I can't say for certain.|That doesn't fill me with confidence.|Does it fill you with dread?|Not... completely.|Well that's OK then.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I found a radio and sent a transmission back to earth!|Good job, we don't really need rescuing though.|It wasn't a distress signal, it just said \"Dad smells like old cheese\".|Oh, uh, great!|I knew you'd like it!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Someone should come mow this grass.|It'd be a very big job.|We just need to find a very big guy, with a very big lawnmower.|Some kind of lawnmower golem? With blades all over his arms? And a cute little hat?|Yes! Perfect! Get him to call me!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, are horses just big dogs, or are dogs just small horses?|Um, neither?|So you're saying they are the same size?|No, I'm saying they are completely different animals.|Well they taste the same to me.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"Hi Dad, I'm mountaineering!|How's it going?|I'm not dressed for the conditions, and I have no previous experience!|So... pretty good then?|Yep! I hope I don't die!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's very wet here. I should have worn my jacket.|I don't think it would have helped.|You haven't seen my jacket. It's a very good jacket.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad can I try volleyball?|Sure, you want to join a team?|No, I want to BE the volleyball.|Uh, yeah that could work, I guess. I'll ask someone.|I just feel like if I was flying through the air, getting knocked in different directions, then the bad thoughts couldn't get to me. You know?|The bad thoughts?|Yes, the darkness deep within the pit of my soul.|Oh, right. Yeah it would probably help!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hello!|*SCREEEECH*|And the same to you, my friend.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi, Dad, I got a new job! I'm a receptionist!|Shouldn't you have a desk and a phone?|Nah, I'm a free range receptionist. People can sort themselves out.|How modern!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I made you a present!|Oh wow, thanks! What is it?|It's an old sock, full of bees!|Oh, uh, great.|Don't worry, the bees are dead!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"DOGS, BEES, CARS AND CHEESE! DON'T TOUCH MY KNEES 'COS I HAVE A DISEASE!|Huh?|BOATS, OATS, GOATS AND STOATS! COME TO MY CASTLE AND BATHE IN THE MOAT!|Are you... rapping?|It's my new hit single!|I'm not so sure about those rhymes .|It's the number one song in over 30 countries!|I stand corrected.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad! I found 100 thousand dollars!|Whoa, what? That's crazy!|I traded it for some magic beans!|Oh.|Then I fed the magic beans to a cow.|You did?|They made her very, very sick.|Oh no!|So I got a refund on the beans and used the money to take the cow to the doctor. She's doing much better now.|So just a typical Tuesday then?");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm going to bite you!|Please don't.|I love to chomp! I'm a bitey little guy!|Can't you just chomp something healthy instead? A vegetable, maybe?|You're a vegetable!|Oops, I forgot.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hate networking! I'm purposely burning my bridges!|Aren't you worried that you might need some of these people's help one day?|Nope! And once all my bridges are burnt, I'm going start burning other people's bridges.|Wait, are you talking about work relationships still, or actual bridges?|BOTH. You can't commute to work without the bridge!|Well there IS a tunnel...|Fine then, I'm burning bridges and flooding tunnels!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"What's the difference between a jungle and a forest?|Uh, one has snakes and the other has bears. I forget which is which though.|What if they have both?|Then you should probably leave.|What if the snakes are riding on the bears?|Then you should quickly take a photo and then leave.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"How many trees do you need for it to be a forest?|Thirty two.|Wow, that's very specific. How did you know that?|I just looked deep inside my soul and the knowledge was revealed to me.|You just made it up, didn't you?|Yep.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad! I'm on an adventure!|How's that working out for you?|So far I've bought a chocolate milk, met a nice cat and took a stroll down by the seaside. So, pretty good!|Sounds... exciting.|I also killed a dragon!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Didn't you quit your job, Dad? How do you still have any money left?|Oh, I cut back on my spending and now I don't really need any money at all.|What were you buying before?|Eggs, mostly.|Oh yeah makes sense.|And luxury cars.|Luxury cars?!|And candles.|Candles?!|Just in case the power went out.|We don't have power! We live outside!|Just in case we decide to live inside, and then the power goes out.|Better safe than sorry, I guess.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'd like to see a cat. A big fat cat. That would be nice.|Uh, OK?|Just something to think about.|It's good to have dreams, I guess.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad!|Hey buddy, time to go home.|When we get home, do I have to wear pants?|I'm not even sure HOW you would wear pants.|One leg at a time.|You don't have any legs.|I could get some specially made.|Pants or legs?|Both!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's picnic time!|I don't see any food?|That's because I just like to eat dirt!|I suppose that makes sense, you are a radish.|Yep! I love dirt! Filthy disgusting dirt, full of nasty worms.|Well, uh, enjoy.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad! I've decided to become a chicken.|You have? How does that work?|Bok bok.|I liked you better as a radish.|Bok Bok! Hey I think I laid an egg!|Uh... ew... let's go home.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Look at my fast shoes!|What shoes?|On my feet!|You don't have feet?!|Then why am I so fast?|Youthful enthusiasm? Caffeine?|Maybe I should go get a refund for these shoes.|I think you should.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place smells like my armpit.|You don't have armpits.|My metaphorical armpit.|You might just need a metaphorical bath.|I think you mean a literal bath.|Have both just to be safe.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, can I have 50 bucks?|Uh, maybe, what for?|Definitely not for super sharp knives.|It's for super sharp knives, isn't it?|Only some of it! The rest is for swords!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"No one knows more about sewers than me! I'm the sewer master!|Uh, cool, good for you, sewer master.|Ask me some questions about sewers!|No... I don't want to.|A sewer is an underground tunnel system for transporting sewage from houses and commercial buildings!|Shh.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Oh wow, I guess they're just letting ANYONE go to space now!|Hey!|Well you're not exactly a qualified astronaut, Dad.|Neither are you!|Yes I am! I watched some videos online. Did you know that space is where the shape shifting reptilians live?|The internet was a mistake.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I want to buy a van, Dad!|What for?|I want to drive around solving mysteries!|Oh cool, like ghosts and stuff?|More like the mystery of \"which burger place is the best\".|Oh right .|Also the mystery of \"how far can a van drive under water\".|I don't like these mysteries.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy Valentines Day, Dad! Did anyone send you flowers?|No, but someone did send me a bag of horse manure.|Horse manure?! Gross. Did they leave a card?|Yes, but it just says \"This is all you deserve. You know what you did\".|Do you know what you did?|I have no idea!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Unleash the chaos! Bring the ruckus!|I'd prefer not to.|Get down with the sickness!|That doesn't sound like a good idea.|It's party time, Dad! Time to throw down on the d-floor!|I think I'd rather throw up on the d-floor.|Ugh, OK let's go home.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I've been thinking about it and I've come to the conclusion that most dogs are good dogs.|That's true.|But a goose is a terrible dog.|A goose isn't a dog at all.|Exactly! Terrible.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Can I call room service?|This isn't a hotel.|Then who delivered me those grapes before?|A spooky ghost, maybe?|The grapes did taste kind of haunted.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm going to sharpen my teeth!|What?! Why!?|For chomping, obviously.|Aren't you worried that people might say you look strange?|No, I'll just chomp them until they change their minds.|Sounds convincing.|Exactly!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This is a great place to come if you're interested in huge boulders.|Huge boulders are pretty interesting.|Yeah, it's cool how huge they are compared to smaller, less huge boulders.|Yes, I like that about them too.|It's one of their best qualities.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad! What are you doing here?|Looking for my kids, who have run off for the millionth time...|You should have tried yelling at us!|I don't really like yelling.|You should yell at us now! It'll scare us into behaving!|I'm not going to yell at you.|Can I yell at you instead?|No.|I just love yelling.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This is a cool place to find worms!|How many have you found?|A whole giant sack! I took it to the surface and left it in the back of your car. Hopefully it's not getting too hot out there.|I... don't have a car?|Well it's definitely in the back of someone's car.|Uh oh.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, sorry for running off.|That's OK, thanks for apologizing.|Do I get a prize?|My eternal love and affection.|That sucks! I don't want that!|Oh, well in that case, no.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, I'm a grown-up now!|No you aren't.|I'm going to play with knives!|No you aren't.|I'm going to juggle with knives!|No you aren't.|Forks?|No.|Spoons?|Maybe plastic ones.|Deal.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I feel like I should get paid to be annoying. I like being annoying, I'm good at it.|I don't think anyone is going to pay you for that.|I don't think anyone is going to pay you for that.|Huh?|Huh?|Stop it!|Stop it!|I'll pay you to stop.|Aha, it works!|Aha, it works!|Hey!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Can we live here? It's got enough rooms for all of us!|It's also got a lot of buzz saws, bad guys and ghosts!|Enough ghosts for all of us! We'll never be lonely again! Great idea, Dad!|Ugh.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I saw a frog!|Neat, was it a little cutie?|It told me to \"abandon all hope\"!|Oh?|Then it stood up, turned and walked away on its hind legs like a human.|I think it might be time to go home.|Me too!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"There are so many bugs in the grass!|Ew!|Don't you bugs have anything better to do?!|Yeah, go home to your families, bugs!|Yeah! Get a job, bugs!|Yeah! Stop wearing the same underpants for three days in a row, bugs!|Yeah!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"The fish don't want to be my friends.|Did you do something to offend them?|I lined them up and ranked them from least delicious to most delicious.|That'd do it.|I think my judging was very fair!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I think I want to become a veterinarian.|Oh, great!|Yeah, I'm I think I'm done eating meat.|Oh... I think you mean vegetarian, not veterinarian. A veterinarian is a doctor for animals, a vegetarian is someone who doesn't eat meat.|Wait, so, if they aren't the same thing, does that mean... the animal doctors eat their patients?!|Yes.|Really?|They probably just have a sneaky little nibble. A hoof here, a tail there.|You're messing with me!|I am.|Phew!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"This jungle is a bit of a maze, do you think we can find our way out?|Yep, after we finish this conversation we will probably just do a little dance and fly away.|Really? That doesn't sound right.|Trust me!|If you say so!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, what's the deal with clowns?|You'll have to be more specific.|Like, why do they exist?|Oh, you know what, I don't really know. I think maybe if you get bit by a clown you turn into one.|And what do they want?|To drink people's blood, I think.|Are you sure you're not thinking of vampires?|Wait, there's a difference?");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, why do people hate pineapple on pizza?|Well I guess it's because it's not considered a traditional pizza topping.|I think it's delicious!|Me too.|I think all pizza should have pineapple on it!|That might be going a bit far.|All pineapple and nothing else!|Maybe you just want to eat a pineapple?|Ooh, good idea!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Panic the possum! What are you doing here?|*SCREEEECH*|I see!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Welcome to my dance party, Dad!|Uh, thanks. But you're not dancing?|It's like the old saying goes \"sing when no one's listening, dance when no one's watching\".|I think it's supposed to be \"dance LIKE no one's watching\".|But people would see me! That doesn't sound right.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm saving all my money so I can buy expensive jewellery!|Well, if it makes you happy, I say go for it.|It does! I'm going to be completely encrusted with precious gems!|Oh, uh, great.|People will see me from a distance and say \"Is that guy covered in horrible warts? Or does he have a strange rash?\".  Then they will get closer and say \"Oh, it's actually just gems! Phew!\".|Certainly something to aspire to.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Why do people even bother with shipping anymore? Just send an email like a normal person.|You can't use email to send physical items. You can't email a car!|Yes you can! You just click \"Add Attachment\".|Oh right. Technology is amazing.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I chucked my phone into the sea!|Why did you do that?|I was addicted to mobile gaming! Now I'm free!|I'm proud of you, buddy.|Now the only way I can crush candies is if I go to the candy shop with a hammer!|Haha yeah! So what are you going to do now?|I'm going to go buy a hammer.|Uh...");_fZ1(global._NK3,"We should go to the sun next!|I think it might be a bit too hot there.|Don't worry I have sun block, we'll be fine.|That's coconut oil.|Oh, I'm sure it will work just the same.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I can't wait to vote in an election! I'm going to vote so many times!|You can only vote once per election buddy, otherwise that's voter fraud.|Says you.|And the law.|Oh well, I had better make my one vote count.|Who are you going to vote for?|Whichever candidate is most likely to forgive voter fraud.|Hmm.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"We have a hot tap and a cold tap, right? But what if we had a third one?|What would come out of the third one?|Maybe... jelly.|I don't know if we need that much jelly.|OK, what about... spiders.|That sounds horrible!|Not if you're thirsty for spiders!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad I'm worried that I'm a slow learner.|You're fine, besides there are more important things to worry about right now.|Like what?|Missing kids!|Oh yeah, that's bad.|Yeah.|Ooh, also, global thermonuclear war!|Yeah, that's bad too.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"These caves make me feel claustrophobic. I feel like the walls are closing in.|Maybe they are?|That's not very reassuring.|Oh, uh, if it makes you feel better I think they are moving very, very slowly. You could probably take a nap and still have time to escape.|Let's just go home.|Good plan.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, you haven't done the laundry in a while and I'm starting to stink.|We... we don't wear clothes .|So?|So, we don't have any laundry to do.|Sounds like an excuse to me.|You probably just need a bath.|Never!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I'm thinking of becoming an animal psychologist.|That sounds like an interesting career.|Yeah! I think I'll become a hamster that teaches you how to manage your anxiety! Or a parakeet that does cognitive behavioural therapy!|Uh...|Ooh, or a horse that helps with intrusive thoughts!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Bread is the tastiest vegetable.|Bread's not a vegetable, buddy.|Well, it comes from wheat, and wheat is a plant.|Yes, but the the grain is harvested from the wheat, which is then ground into flour and used to make the bread.|So it's... a fancy vegetable?|Uh, OK sure what ever.|Bread is the fanciest vegetable.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"STOP RIGHT THERE! You're under arrest!|What?!|I'm practicing to be a cop!|Are you thinking of going to police college?|Nah, I think I'll just start being a cop.|I don't think you can do that.|Sure I can, I have a badge and everything.|Where'd you get that?|I made it out of cardboard. NOW PUT YOUR HANDS WHERE I CAN SEE THEM!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, the printer is out of toner.|What are you printing that's so important?|Cool pictures of guys doing karate.|Sounds important.|And a list of all the different sorts of hats.|I'll go find the toner.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, have you ever seen an ostrich?|No, and I never want to. They give me the creeps.|Why's that?|Long necked freaks... they are basically a dinosaur.|Dinosaurs are cool!|Yeah but I don't want to kiss one.|Who said anything about kissing?|I'm just saying!");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"I have amazing emotional intelligence. I'm an empath - I just feel other people's emotions really deeply, you know?|Hm, most so-called \"empaths\" that I've met have turned out to be the least empathetic people ever.|Oh not me though, I am very empathetic.|And modest!|Oh yeah I'm super modest, I'm the best at it.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I think it's time I got a job.|What sort of job were you thinking of?|Maybe a CEO.|CEO of what?|Oh, I'm not picky as long as it pays well.|I think you need quite a lot of experience before you can be a CEO.|Well I'll just look for an entry level CEO position so I can start from the bottom.|Good luck!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad! I've taken up hunting for sport!|Oh, cool. Not really my thing, but good for you I guess.|Just last week I got two basketballs with one bullet!|Huh?|Today I completely ruined a tennis match! Everyone was screaming!|I think you might have misunderstood what \"hunting for sport\" means.|But I'm so good at it!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think knights and kings and stuff used to live here?|Maybe! Or maybe just two high-flying dog show judges and their five disappointing children.|What makes you say that?|Just a guess.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I read in the newspaper that the world is coming to an end. Do you think it's true?|I mean, the climate is changing rapidly and we could be on the verge of war, but who knows. Worrying about it doesn't do us much good. We should just try to enjoy each day as it comes. Anyway, I don't think you should believe everything you read in the paper.|I read on the internet that the government is secretly controlled by shape shifting reptilians.|Shape shifting reptilians?! Oh no!!");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"It's quite windy, we should fly a kite!|Do you have a kite?|No, I was hoping you had one.|It's not the sort of thing I just carry around with me.|I guess we can just imagine a kite?|...wow, this is... awesome!|Hooray!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"What this desert needs is an ice cream parlor.|That would be pretty great right now.|And downstairs they could have an ice cream dungeon.|Uh, sure.|Across the street they could have an ice cream stadium!|...Are you OK?|I think I've been in the sun too long.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"Do you think they will deliver food out here?|I'm not sure how they would find us.|I'll just say I'm by the tree.|There's quite a few trees, how will they know which one?|Oh right. I'll say I'm by the medium sized tree, the one with all the leaves.|OK, problem solved.|Time for pizza!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad can I get a motorcycle?|Absolutely not.|Ugh, because it's too unsafe?|No, because you're a radish. I just don't know how you'd physically operate a motorcycle.|I'd rig up something with pulleys, levers and some bungee cords.|I'll consider it.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Let's make some sand castles!|Sure! Good idea.|Then after that let's make a sand mall.|OK, sure I guess.|Then we can go to the sand food court.|OK.|And get some sandwiches.|Sand sandwiches?|Don't be ridiculous.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"One of these containers is for me!|Is that so?|Yep! I haven't decided which one yet though. I'll just crack a few open and see if there's anything I like inside.|Uh, I don't think it works like that. That sounds like stealing to me.|So what? It's not like stealing is a crime.|Stealing is totally a crime.|Are you sure? I think you are thinking of \"murder\".|Nope, stealing is definitely a crime.|Hmm, that does explain why I keep going to jail.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I'm a giant tortoise!|No you aren't.|FOOLED YOU! Haha, it's April Fool's day, Dad!|You didn't fool me. You're clearly not a tortoise.|You looked so surprised!|No I didn't.|What a fool! Haha!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, didn't you used to keep bees?|I did, but it turned out I was allergic so I had to stop.|What happened?|They stung me and I swelled up to twice my normal size.|That doesn't sound like an allergy... that sounds like a super power! Giant Dad!|I couldn't breathe .|I'm going to go find some bees! Giant Dad!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Ah vanilla, the absence of flavor.|Vanilla IS a flavor.|Then why is the plain ice cream called vanilla?|It's not plain, it's vanilla flavored.|You're not making any sense, Dad.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place isn't so scary if you pretend it's a just a really convincing movie set.|That's not a bad idea.|Yeah, just pretend all the ghosts are actors.|\"The ghosts are just actors\", got it.|And pretend that if you die you'll just respawn.|Actually I think that last one might be true.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"What this place needs is a dehumidifier. It's very damp.|It's the bottom of the ocean! We are literally under water!|So you don't think a dehumidifier would work?|No, of course not!|OK, TWO dehumidifiers then.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm trying out some slogans to get people to eat healthy.|Oh, cool, let's hear them.|\"Salad, the bounty of the forest\"!|Nice.|\"Vegetables - nature's meat\"!|Are you sure you should be trying to convince people to eat vegetables? They might eat you!|Oh... uh... \"Vegetables - Nature's gross slime\". \"Salad, the poop of the forest\".|Much better.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's nice here under the ground.|I guess so.|It's like a cozy little tomb.|Uh...|A cuddly little grave.|You're kind of putting me off.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, have you ever got a slam dunk?|In basketball?|Yes.|Yeah all the time.|Wow!|I'd probably be an NBA player if life had worked out different.|What stopped you?|I'm a talking radish in a moderately popular video game series.|Oh yeah, life's like that sometimes.|It sure is.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, why did you quit your job?|I'm just not the sort of guy that shines in a big corporate setting. I'm too quiet I think. I'd do good work, and other people would take credit for it. They'd get promoted, while I was just stagnating. So I decided to quit.|Oh, fair enough.|Also, I'd been stealing pens from the office and I'm pretty sure they were on to me.|How many did you steal?|Thousands.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, want some mud?|No thanks.|Good, all the more mud for me!|What do you need mud for?|I'm making you a present!|Ooh what is it?|An old glove filled with mud!|Oh, uh, hooray.|MUD GLOVE!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Is it weird that we drink cow's milk?|Only if you think about it.|Why don't we drink other animal's milk?|I do.|Really?|Yep, the trick is to wait until they are sleeping.|To milk the animals?|Yeah. Bee's milk is the hardest to get, but also the most delicious.|Weird.|Don't bother with pigeon milk though, it's disgusting.|Noted.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"What's your favourite video game, Dad?|I like that one with the blue hedgehog. I think it's called... Mr Blue Guy the Very Fast Rodent (With Spikes).|That's not what it's called and you know it.|I also like that one with the Italian plumber who eats mushrooms. I think it's called...|Don't say it.|Giuseppe Fixes The Drains (While Eating a Fungus Salad).|You are very annoying sometimes, Dad.|I try my best.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm the queen of the swamp!|Can I call you Swampy for short?|No! You must call me \"your majesty\" or you will be thrown to the eels!|But I like eels, Swampy.|Well they don't like you!|They don't?|They've been spreading rumours about you behind your back!|Time to go home, Swampy.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, you should try getting a tan.|I did... I'm actually a white radish who is extremely sunburnt.|Oh no, seriously?!|No.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I think if there were aliens around here we would have seen them by now.|Maybe they are hiding?|Why would they hide from me? Can't they see how cool I am?|Maybe they find your coolness intimidating.|COME OUT ALIENS! DON'T BE INTIMIDATED BY MY COOLNESS! I'M ACTUALLY VERY NORMAL AND DOWN TO EARTH!|...|See, no aliens.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"There's a lot of bricks in this place, Dad.|That's cool, but we should go home now.|I can't leave until I've counted all the bricks.|How many have you counted so far?|Forty three thousand, seven hundred and six.|Maybe you should quit while you are ahead?|No!|Come on, buddy.|Argh, I lost count.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy International Bat Appreciation day, Dad!|My favorite holiday! Time to go appreciate some bats.|I tried to appreciate some bats, but I got too close and they screeched at me. Then they flew away.|Maybe they don't know what day it is?|We should put a calendar in their cave.|Good idea.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think you'll want to be a mom one day, Dad?|I'm already a dad.|Oh right.|I'm pretty busy with being a dad, so being a mom as well sounds like too much work.|That's true.|Plus I barely know what I'm doing as it is.|That's true too.|Hey!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"After being down here for a little while, I've come to realise, a sewer is not a great place to live.|You only just figured that out?|Yeah, the WiFi is really bad down here and the tap water tastes weird.|That's true.|Also the mutants keep tickling me when I'm asleep.|I guess that's not everyone's cup of tea.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, If you were a ghost, what would you do?|Hmm. I'd probably read a book.|Read a book!?|Or play a video game, maybe.|That's boring! What about ghost stuff?|I just like doing regular stuff.|If I was a ghost I'd paint little hats on famous works of art.|You don't need to be a ghost to do that.|OK then I'll do it!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad can we go to the zoo? I want to see a giraffe!|I'm a bit busy right now. Maybe once I've found the rest of you kids.|Giraffes are so awesome, I wish I had a long neck like a giraffe.|Any neck at all would be nice.|I have a neck! It's, uh, in the middle... somewhere.|I'll take your word for it.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I like it here in the jongle.|You mean the Jungle.|Jangle.|Jungle.|Jingle!|JUNGLE!|Jongle.|Ugh.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad are you into fashion? You seem like a fashionable guy.|I don't even wear clothes.|Ah! So, you have a minimalist approach to clothing. Less is more!|I just haven't really found any clothes that suit me.|So you're a nudist?|No, I'm a vegetable.|Oh, fair enough.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"The great thing about the desert is there's as much sand as you can eat.|Yeah, I mean, I suppose that's true.|The worst thing about the desert is that sand tastes horrible.|I can think of worse things.|Like what?|Murderous sand beasts with poisonous quills and razor-sharp teeth.|Oh, yeah, that is totally worse.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've been asked to report to HR.|Oh no!|Also I don't actually know what HR is.|It stands for hairy raisins.|Oh no!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Who keeps leaving all these shells everywhere?|Shell goblins, probably.|SHELL GOBLINS?!|Yes, they live in the sea and their job is to evenly distribute all of the shells.|Who pays them?|Michael.|Michael who?|Ah, you know, Michael. I can't remember his surname. He works down at the post office.|Michael from the post office is the boss of the shell goblins?!|Yeah, he really likes shells.|I never would have guessed!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I like floating around up here. It's very peaceful.|But there's bad guys trying to kill us everywhere!|Yes, but we are completely safe from tsunamis and landslides.|That's a good point.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I bet some of these containers are full of delicious cakes!|I don't know if that's the sort of thing people ship overseas. I feel like the cakes might go bad.|Pshh, whatever, hater. You're going to feel pretty silly when I find those cakes.|Good luck!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"What's your favourite romantic comedy movie, Dad?|Um, that one with the emails... I forget.|I like the one with the dinosaurs on an island!|I don't think that one counts as a romantic comedy.|The dinosaurs were all smooching, it was hilarious.|Oh, uh, where did you see this movie?|On some website about dinosaurs smooching.|I think I'm going to take your internet privileges away for a while.|Yeah, that might be for the best.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey, Panic the possum! Have you see my kids around here?|*SCREEEECH*|That's exactly how I feel, too.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Maybe this place isn't actually haunted.|What do you mean?|Maybe there's a gas leak and we are just hallucinating.|I think I'd rather it was haunted.|Gas is pretty spooky!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, can we make a mudman?|A mudman?|Yeah! It's like a snowman, but made out of mud!|Sure, sounds fun!|Then we can find a witch to curse it and bring it to life!|Um, I don't know about that.|Then it will do our evil bidding!|Can it do the dishes?|Sure!|OK let's do it then.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I saw a bear!|Oh no, where!?|On the road on the way here.|What was it doing?!|Driving a red stationwagon.|Uh... are you sure it was a bear?|Yep, it looked at me and growled!|We should probably get out of here just in case.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Whenever I come to the forest I start sneezing!|Do you think maybe it's your allergies?|Oh no, I'm sneezing on purpose. I come here and make a conscious decision to start sneezing.|Are you... being sarcastic?|I'm not even sure anymore.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"Someone should buy all this land and turn it into a nice big parking lot.|What?! That's awful.|Think of all the cars you could park. Big ones, small ones, medium sized ones. Anything you want!|You'd really get rid of this idyllic meadow just for that?|YOU COULD PARK MONSTER TRUCKS!|That... does sound pretty cool actually.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"You ever read that book about that one guy and the other guy and they go and do that thing?|You'll have to be more specific .|Um... there was a dog... I think?|Oh! Yes I know the one!|I can't remember the name.|Me neither. Good book though .|Totally.|Very memorable .|I'll be thinking about it for years to come.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"This hotel is awful, all the rooms are booby trapped.|It's not a hotel!|It's not? Well in that case I'm checking out early.|You can't check out because you never checked in!|Well I'm going to leave a negative review on the internet, then.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy Mother's Day, Dad!|Uh, thanks, but shouldn't you be saying that to your mom?|Yeah, but I don't know where she is. I haven't seen her in months.|Oh well, happy Mother's Day to me, then!|You're the best mom ever, Dad.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I love cheese, but how do you think they invented it?|I'm not sure.|Do you think someone just left some milk out for way too long and then was all like \"hmm that looks... tasty\".|I think there's more to making cheese than just leaving milk out.|I'm going to leave some milk out and see if it turns into cheese.|Let me know how it goes.|You can have the first taste!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"What do you think dentists do with all the teeth they pull out?|They probably throw them into the sea.|If I was a dentist I would smash them all together to make one giant tooth.|Interesting.|Then I'd use the giant tooth to bite giant things like a bus or a glacier.|I'm glad you're not a dentist.|Me too.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"What's your favourite food, Dad?|Hardboiled eggs.|Is that because it's the only thing you can cook?|It's not the only thing I CAN cook, it's just the only thing I CHOOSE to cook.|OK well if you CHOOSE to cook a pizza we might run away less.|Good point.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"How high in the mountains do we need to go before we need to bring our own oxygen?|I guess we'll find out one way or another.|Are you feeling sleepy at all?|Yes.... but I always feel sleepy so I wouldn't worry.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I met some cool strangers in a chat room online!|I don't know if it's a great idea to be talking to strangers, buddy.|They invited me to come meet them in their murder dungeon!|Murder dungeon!!?|Oh don't worry that's just their nickname for the basement apartment that they all live in.|Oh well in that case it sounds fine and safe to me.|Cool!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hippos look cute, but they are scary!|Yeah, they are one of the most dangerous animals there is.|I hope I never run into one in the wild!|Or at your job.|Or at the mall!|Might be OK at an all-you-can-eat buffet, they might be distracted by all the food.|Or an ice-skating rink, if you saw a hippo there you could just slide away quickly .|OK good plan.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hope I get eaten by a shark.|I don't!|Well, we're radishes. Someone's probably going to eat us eventually. Sharks are awesome, so why not a shark?|I'm not going to be eaten by anyone!|You're not?|No! I'm going to go bad in the back of someone's fridge and then eventually get thrown into the compost.|Good for you, Dad!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad can we get a TV?|We live outside so we don't really have anywhere to plug it in.|I want to watch that one sitcom from the 90's, you know the one.|The one with the big family?|Yes!|And they all live in a house together?|Yes! And they can't stop screaming.|Huh?|They are just constantly screaming. It's horrible and relentless .|I don't remember that one .|It might have been a dream.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, remember that breakfast cereal that had freeze dried chunks of meat in it? I think it was called \"Lil' Beefies\".|No, I do not remember that.|Me neither!|Huh?|But it sounds delicious.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"They confiscated my stapler!|Were you stapling in a non-stapling area?|Only briefly!|Were you stapling outside of the designated stapling hours?|Just a little!|Well, you only have yourself to blame.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, do you think fedoras will ever come back in style?|I really hope not.|I think you would look adorable in a fedora.|Fedorable?|I wouldn't go that far.|I think you would look fedorable in a fedora.|Please stop saying \"fedorable\".|No.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, want to buy this old sack full of frogs?|Uh, no?|Come on! It's great value. Some of the frogs are even still alive!|I don't want that, thanks.|Oh well, more frogs for me!|Enjoy!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"The sea is the most beautiful place in the world!|I think so too!|It doesn't taste beautiful though, it tastes like garbage.|It is quite salty.|It's just disgusting.|Yes.|A horrible taste.|Stop drinking it!|No!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"My dream is to climb a mountain and play an electric guitar at the top!|I don't want to shoot down your dreams buddy, but you might find that quite difficult .|Why? Because there's nowhere to plug an amp in at the top of a mountain?|No, because you don't have hands.|Don't be a hater, Dad!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Shipwrecks are so cool and mysterious! So much lost treasure to find!|Not so great for the people who were on the ships though .|I'm sure they are fine.|I really don't think they are.|True, they are probably sad about losing all that treasure.|And drowning.|That too!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I put on too much sun block!|That's ok, you just won't get a tan.|But I'm a plant! I need sunlight to live!|Oh yeah, good point.|I'll be very pale and very dead!|Let's go get you cleaned up.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"Hey Dad, I've been achieving all my goals!|That's great, what's your secret?|I just make a list of all the things I want to do, and I cross them off as I complete them, it really helps!|Good tip!|I also make my goals really easy to achieve. I set my sights super low!|Oh right.|My list for today just says \"Be alive, Stare blankly into space, Think about horses\". I've already achieved two of those things!|Good for you.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Bears, bears the musical fruit, the more you eat the more you toot!|Beans.|Huh?|That song is about beans, not bears.|But beans aren't a fruit.|Neither are bears!|I'll eat both just to be safe.|Please don't.|I'm going to be a musician!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"What do you think this place is for anyway?|Maybe it's a space prison for very naughty boys and girls. Maybe you'll finally have to face the consequences for running away so often!|Maybe. Or maybe it's an interstellar disco!|But there's hardly anyone here.|That's because it's not party time yet! Just wait!|No.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I wish I had a pet fox.|Foxes are wild animals, you probably shouldn't have one as a pet.|They are basically just spicy dogs.|They might be a bit bitey.|I would teach it to only bite people who looked at me funny.|That still doesn't sound super safe.|Not for you!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I've decided to live forever!|How are you going to do that?|I don't know... technology... and, uh... vitamins?|Sounds like a plan.|I'll never die, so you can use my funeral money to buy me lots of toys instead!|Yeah, I'm not doing that.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, who is the greatest athlete of all time?|I'm not sure, I've never really thought about it. Maybe it's... me?|You?!|Well I can double jump, most athletes can't do that.|I guess.|And I'm constantly jumping over obstacles, leaping from platforms, narrowly avoiding danger. I do lots of flips too!|OK, Dad, sure. You're the greatest athlete of all time.|Awesome!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, what's your favourite sport to watch?|Hmm... I once watched an egg eating competition. That was pretty cool.|I'm not sure if that's a sport.|Forklift racing is fun to watch!|I don't know if that's a thing.|Knife Chess is exciting too, although not for the faint of heart.|Knife Chess?!|Night Knife Chess is good too but harder to watch because it's usually dark.|If you say so.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"HI DAD! I'M WIRED ON COLD-BREW COFFEE!|Oh.|I CAN SEE THROUGH TIME!|That doesn't sound healthy to me.|FEAR NOT, MORTAL! I HAVE REACHED A HIGHER PLANE OF EXISTENCE!|I think you might need to lie down.|I THINK I MIGHT NEED A DOCTOR.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, does anything ever make you nervous?|Are you kidding? You kids are constantly going missing. I'm a nervous wreck.|Really? You always seem so relaxed.|I think you might be mistaking my exhaustion for calmness.|You're always chilling out!|I'm too tired to move!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I had a cool dream! I went on a road trip with a funky weasel! We got milkshakes and went hang gliding!|That sounds pretty great! I had a dream where all my kids were safe at home and I was in my nice soft bed.|Where were you when you woke up?|Under a table, next to some trash.|Lucky!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"What are you going to do when we get home?|Probably build a fence to stop you kids escaping again. How about you?|Probably build a ladder... for uh... climbing... trees?|There's not much point in me building a fence, is there?|Not really, no.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I wonder how The Dolphin The Dolphin is doing.|Probably... not great? I think he's gone for good.|Such a nice guy.|He turned out to be evil and tried to cook us into soup, remember?|No? Are you sure? The Dolphin The Dolphin?|Yeah, I was there!|I think you're misremembering things, Dad.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, what do you like to do in your spare time?|I like to nap. But whenever I nap you kids seem to go missing.|I like going missing!|I think you need a new hobby. Maybe badminton?|Ooh, or knife juggling!|Uh.|Or fire eating!|Maybe just stick to going missing.|OK!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Aren't you supposed to be homeschooling us?|How can I homeschool you when you never stay at home?!|Video conference calls, duh.|I'm not doing that.|I'M HUNGRY FOR KNOWLEDGE, DAD.|Just read the internet, there's tons of things to learn on there.|That's where I learnt to make bombs!|Hmm.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Bananas are delicious, but do you think it's weird for a radish to be eating a banana?|No weirder than a radish eating anything else.|Isn't it kind of close to cannibalism though? I mean, radishes and bananas are pretty much the same.|No, they really aren't.|Also the banana wouldn't stop screaming.|Oh, uh...|I didn't know what to do, so I started screaming too and I let him go home.|Oh that's good.|He was pretty mad though.|Fair enough.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Working for a big company is a scam. You spend most of your life in an office working overtime and making barely enough to get by. Just so the lazy rich scumbag at the top can get even richer.|Wow, it sounds like you should definitely quit.|Oh, I don't work here, I'm just here to steal pens.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Fatherhood's tough, dude. My kids have gone missing for what seems like the hundredth time. Maybe I'm just a bad father?|*SCREEEECH*|You, know what, you're right! If I was a bad father I wouldn't be out here looking for them. Thanks man, good pep-talk.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I ordered a pizza but it still hasn't shown up!|How long has it been?|Two days! I'm starting to think it's not coming.|Let's go home.|But what if it shows up?!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, can I join the military?|I'd prefer if you didn't. What if you get sent somewhere far away?|I'd be fine, they make you wear helmets.|I'd still be very worried about you.|Maybe they would shoot me out of a cannon!|See, this is exactly why I worry.|That sounds awesome!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"While we are here we should mine some precious gems.|What are we going to do with precious gems?|We could look really fancy when we go to the club.|We don't go to the club!|We could start!|I don't even know any clubs!|Maybe there's a bridge club we could sign up to.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place is filthy! Someone needs to clean up all this mud.|This place is ALL mud. If you cleaned up the mud there wouldn't be anything left.|That sounds fantastic. The vast peaceful nothingness of the void. Floating forever in the deep, dark abyss.|That sounds scary!|Finally I could take a little nap. Let's get cleaning!|No!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"What happened to all your friends, Dad?|Well Burgurgular went back to doing crimes and might be on the run. Momato went back to work so we probably won't see her for a few years. And The Dolphin The Dolphin turned out to be an evil sea wizard or something, so we aren't speaking.|It must be hard making friends in your 80s.|I'm 35!|So sad, so close to death.|You're grounded.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I'm illegally downloading MP3s from the internet!|No you aren't!|Yeah, you're right. I don't know what any of those things are. But if I did, I bet I would be.|What are you really doing?|Talking to bees, starting fires, you know normal stuff.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I wonder who built this place?|Some kind of ancient, highly advanced, yet long forgotten civilization.|It was probably just one really buff lady. With really big strong arms.|Could be!|I bet she had a really cool truck.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"There's a lot of bad guys around, do you think we should call the police?|Are they really that bad?|They tried to kill you!|I'm sure they didn't mean to.  Besides, the cops might freak out because they've never seen a talking radish before.|That's true, you might get sent to jail for being a sentient vegetable.|Is that a crime?|I'm not sure, but let's not take the risk.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy Father's Day, Dad! You're the best.|Thanks buddy.|I made you this pinecone.|Oh, uh, thanks. What did you make it out of?|I made it out of a pinecone.|So you just picked up a pinecone off the ground and gave it to me?|Yes.|Well, it's the thought that counts.|You're welcome!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, can I get a phone?|So you can call me and let me know where you're going?|Uh, yeah totally... and maybe for games...|Mobile games are terrible buddy, they are full of microtransactions and ads.|Oh, OK, so you'll get me a game console instead?|We'll see.|That means no, doesn't it?|We'll see.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Whales are huge!|They sure are!|I bet you could fit a whole bus inside a whale.|I think you could.|Can we try? I know where a bus is.|Uh... maybe later.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've been wandering around here for days. I'm starting to lose my mind!|Lucky for you, I'm here to take you home.|No! I like losing my mind! It's refreshing.|I think I should get you some water.|I don't need water! I'm finally free from the shackles of my own sanity! I'm floating on a fluffy pink cloud born of my own lunacy!|What about juice?|Oh, yes please, juice sounds good.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"You'd think this beach would be more popular, it's practically deserted.|Apart from all the bad guys.|Yeah, apart from them.|And all the dangerous spikes and stuff.|Yeah apart from that.|I can't imagine why no one else wants to come here!|Me neither.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"We could get across this desert quicker if we had some camels.|That's true, but I don't see any camels around here.|We could make some out of some horses and some paper mache.|I don't see any of those things either.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Would you rather have a cool car, or a cool house?|Either would be pretty good!|A man's home is his castle, and a man's car is also his castle, but smaller and with wheels.|That's very true and wise.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"A monkey stole my phone!|Oh no!|Can you buy me a new one please, Dad?|I don't think I can afford it sorry.|But how will I take my selfies?|You could just stare aimlessly into the mirror for hours on end - it might have the same effect?|Good idea!");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"Dad, am I the funniest person you've met?|Funny as in hilarious, or funny as in strange?|Both?|Yes.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, you should try this app!|What does it do?|It takes a photo of your face and makes you look like a supermodel!|Does it also secretly send your photo and all your information to a shady corporation?|Yes, of course.|I'll pass.|Your loss! I look BEAUTIFUL!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hope I don't fall down a ravine!|Me too!|It's my life's goal.|Your life's goal is to not fall down a ravine?|Yes.|Good on you for dreaming big.|Thanks Dad!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Frogs are just friends you haven't met yet!|Are you sure that's the expression?|A frog in the hand is worth two in the bush!|I'm not sure that's right.|People who live in glass houses shouldn't throw frogs.|No one should throw frogs!|That's true. Unless your house is on fire and you are throwing it to safety .|Good point.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm going to stow away on a boat!|If it makes you happy, I say go for it.|Then, when the sailors least expect it I'll jump out and give them a big fright!|What will you do after that?|I'll jump into the sea before they have time to shoot me with a harpoon!|And after that?|I haven't thought that far ahead. Maybe I'll be rescued by a turtle.|Sounds like plan!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place needs more snakes.|I don't want to meet any snakes, but I do see what you mean. Aesthetically this place just screams \"snakes!\"|It really is a glaring omission. I wonder if there's a suggestion box somewhere.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I really want to see a mountain goat.|How come?|I want to tell it there are easier places to live.|Haha, fair enough.|Stupid goat, stop living on a mountain. Stop making life difficult for yourself. Don't you want to live in a meadow, or in an alley behind a fast food restaurant?|You've really thought about this.|It's all I ever think about.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Did you know that no two leaves are the same?|I think you are thinking of snowflakes.|No it's definitely leaves.|Look on the ground there, those leaves are identical.|Those ones don't count.|Why not?|You probably just put those there to fool me.|Why would I do that?|Because you hate leaf facts.|Well, I mean, that is true.|So you admit it!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Why do earthquakes happen, Dad?|Uh, something to do with tectonic plates moving around...|What's a tectonic plate?|I, uh, it's under the ground and, uh, um. Look I don't really know.|I think earthquakes are the earth farting!|Let's go with that, then.|Yay!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, what is it that you liked about Mom when you first met her?|She was a very large... tomato...|Yes... and?|It's hard to put into words.|Go on, try!|She was... very tomatoey... and quite... big.|You're just really into big tomatoes, aren't you.|I have a type!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"They say that this is waste water, but I think it's only a waste if you're not going to drink it.|Please don't drink it, it's filthy.|One man's trash is another man's treasure!");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"Dad, why don't we ever go to the movies?|Well there's about 360 of us, and most movie theatres only seat about 250 people.|So? Leave some of us behind.|I can't do that, it wouldn't be fair! How would I choose.|Just make the smelliest ones stay behind.|That would require lining you all up and smelling you.|Good plan!|I'm not doing that.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I've decided to take up a disgusting habit in order to scare off all but the truest of friends.|That seems strange and unnecessary, but if it makes you happy then go for it.|I can't decide between eating boogers or showering in sour milk, what do you think?|Why not both?|You're a genius, Dad!|Also, you could try rubbing blue cheese under your armpits!|Genius!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I think I dropped my keys around here somewhere...|What were the keys for?|Nothing in particular, I just like the way they jingle jangle.|I'm afraid they might be gone for good, buddy.|Oh and one of them was for a rusty old van filled with depleted uranium that I was supposed to smuggle out of the country for a shady secret society.|Uh...|Oh wait, here it is! It was in my pocket all along!|You have pockets!?");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm catching fish!|Where's your fishing rod?|I don't need one. I just use my positive mental attitude to convince fish to jump out of the water and into my mouth.|Had any luck so far?|Any second now!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think about the future much, Dad?|Sure. I think about lunch quite a lot.|I mean further in the future. Like, I worry about how climate change is going to affect us in the future, and how fascism seems to be on the rise around the world.|I worry about what's for lunch.|The future's scary, isn't it Dad?|It sure is.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hope I see a yeti! I'll give him a big kiss!|He might not want that.|I'll ask his permission first.|I don't think yetis understand English.|I thought that might be the case, so I drew a picture of me kissing a yeti to show him, so he understands.|Wow that's a very detailed picture.|Thank you.|You've really captured the moonlight bouncing off his fur.|I've been practicing.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad are you sick of eating ice cream on hot summer days?|No... not really.|Well what if I told you there was a new frozen treat in town?|I'm listening.|Do you like spicy curries?|I do!|Do you like electric guitars?|Somewhat!|Then you're going to love Rockin' Currysicle, the guitar-shaped frozen curry on a stick!|I think you might be on to something!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I wonder if any strange creatures live at the bottom of the swamp?|Stranger than a talking radish?|Yeah! Maybe a... screaming... broccoli.|You can do better than that...|A HISSING, SPITTING ABOMINATION WITH HUGE TALONS AND THOUSANDS OF HORRIBLE YELLOW EYES!|Oh no! Too far! Too far!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think this place is controlled by a super intelligent AI that has gone rogue?|No, it's just controlled by buttons on the wall.|Oh OK cool. That's probably for the best.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Can we go on a family vacation, Dad?|We could go camping, I suppose.|We already live outside!|Well good, then we won't need to go very far, will we?|DAD.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm going to become an athlete so I can get paid the big bucks!|What sort of athlete?|Hmm... I'll be multidisciplined. I'll play multiple sports at once!|I don't think you can do that.|You just say that because no one's done it yet. I'm going to be the first! I'm going to get a slam dunk while also getting a hole-in-one and a touchdown! They'll have to pay me the big bucks then!|They sure will!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I want to get a tattoo!|Well, it's your body, you can do what you want. What are you thinking of getting?|I want a big tattoo on my face that says \"COLLECTABLE HISTORIC COINS\".|Uh, interesting. Any particular reason why?|Yes, but it's personal. You probably wouldn't understand.|Is it because you like to collect historic coins?|...Yes.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This water tastes disgusting at first, but the more you drink the better it gets!|I don't know if that's a good idea, buddy.|Also, the more you drink it, the more new colors you can see!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"This would be a perfect spot to dump my barrels of toxic waste!|What?! That's a terrible thing to do!|Oh, right sorry... I guess I'll just drop them at the playground like usual.|That's terrible too!|The kids love it though, it gives them a healthy green glow.|I'm not convinced.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Are lions actually real? Has anyone actually seen one?|Of course they are real!|Have you seen one?|Uh, not in real life, no.|See!?|But why would lions be fake? Seems like a weird thing to make up.|The government want to keep us scared, so they can keep us under control!|But... most people don't really worry about lions very often.|Good! Fight the power!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, do you think they allow dogs in this office?|I'm not sure. Do you have a dog?|No but I could get some though. I could get... lots.|Sounds good to me!|Let's see how many dogs we can fit in here!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've been hanging around in dockside bars!|Uh, great?|I made friends with some salty sea dogs! Some real unsavoury types!|Cool...|They taught me bad words and showed me how to do tricks with knives!|My little girl is finally growing up.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This is an awful place for a holiday Dad, why did you make us come here?|I didn't!|You were all like \"MY NAME IS DAD! LET'S GO STAY IN THE HAUNTED CASTLE! HOOHOOHEEHAA! I SMELL LIKE AN OLD MAN'S LEG!\"|That doesn't sound like me at all.|Hmm... you're right... it might have been a dream.|No more cheese before bed time, OK?");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's screechin' time!|*SCREEEECH*|Nice!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, what do you want to accomplish before you die?|I want to slash the tires of the guy that keeps parking his car on my grass.|Whoa, Dad, I don't think that's a healthy goal to have!|Oh, uh, sorry. Um... maybe... I want to become best friends with the guy that keeps parking his car on my grass?|That's better. A bit weird, but better.|Then, once I've gained his trust, I'll break his heart by slashing his tires!|Dad!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, have you ever saved anyone's life?|Uh, yes, of course! I save you kids most days!|That doesn't count, that's your job. You have to do that.|I don't have to do anything. Maybe I'll just stop saving your lives and see what happens?|No! I'm sorry Dad, I take it back!|Haha, don't worry, I'm only joking.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, we're out of groceries!|We're radishes. We only really need sunlight, water and soil.|Sunlight, water, soil and a giant bag of tortilla chips.|I don't know about that last one.|I'm a growing boy!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, do you want to play Go Fish?|I, uh, actually don't know how.|Me neither! I was hoping you could teach me.|Maybe we can just figure it out was we go along?|Sounds like a plan. You go get the cards and I'll get a fish.|On it!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I think animals are out to get me.|What makes you think that?|It's just this feeling I have.|Just a feeling?|Yeah and a dog looked at me weird.|Did you do anything to make him look at you weird?|Well, I was eating A LOT of pastrami at the time.|Yeah, I don't think you have anything to worry about.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I think every day should be a public holiday.|But then when would we go to work?|That's the point, we wouldn't.|No one would get anything done! Society would collapse!|I don't care! I'll be at home playing video games!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I am the Prince of Trees! I float with the leaves and dance among the branches!|Oh, yeah, same.|Huh?|I'm that too. Tree prince. That's me.|No! There can only be one Prince of Trees! I'll send you to the tree dungeon!|Well I'll ground you for 3 weeks.|I'm sorry...|...|...your majesty.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I want to get a pegleg like a pirate.|You'd probably need two seeing as you don't have any legs to begin with.|Why stop at two? I want five peglegs!|Five!?|Think of how fast I could run!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's so much fun exploring ancient tombs!|Not as much fun as playing quietly at home.|I hope we find a zombie or a mummy!|Wouldn't you rather go home though?|There's no mummies at home though .|...|...|That's true .|Sorry Dad.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've decided to give up on my dream.|Oh no! Don't give up! What was your dream?|I was flying through the sky on the back of giant cow. The cow was singing a song about filing tax returns!|Oh I see. In that case should totally give up on your dream.|OK cool!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, who's your best friend?|Blorby MacGuffin.|Who's that?|My best friend!|Yes, but how come I've never heard of him?|We only see each other once every few years.|Oh right, does he live far away?|No, he lives not far from here.|What does he do for a living?|I can't remember.|Are you sure he's your best friend.|Yeah, he's a great guy, we go way back.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, what's the worst birthday present you ever got?|Novelty socks.|I think socks are a pretty good present, everyone needs socks!|Not if you don't have feet!|True. Maybe that's why they were a novelty?|They were toe socks. They also had pictures of toes all over them.|That's disgusting.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Remember, Dad, you should dress for the job you want, not the job you have!|The job I want is \"stay-at-home dad\".|Oh well in that case you're doing great.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place would be better if it had a hot tub to relax in.|I think this would be a strange place for a hot tub.|You wouldn't say that if you were in the hot tub.|I think I probably would.|No, you'd be too relaxed. You'd probably be asleep.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, what's the best way to travel?|Steam boat.|Really? Why?|Have you SEEN a steam boat? They are awesome!|I feel like you just said the first thing that came to your head. What about high speed rail?|STEAM BOATS.|OK, OK.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Some of these trees must be really old.|Yeah, some of them would be hundreds of years old.|Just like you!|I'm only 35!|So old! One foot in the grave! It's a wonder you can even get about without a walking frame.|You're grounded...|Oh no!|...until you're 35.|OH NO!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think if a tree dies, it becomes a ghost tree?|Probably not.|How would you know though? It's not like ghost trees can say \"Boo!\" like regular ghosts.|They probably would just look like normal trees.|Yeah, you wouldn't even know they were ghosts until you walked through one of them and they disappeared. You'd be like \"Hey wasn't there a tree there?\". And then you'd go back to hiking or whatever.|Spooky!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I've been learning about hermit crabs online!|Cool! What have you learned?|Hermit crabs are anomuran decapod crustaceans of the superfamily Paguroidea that have adapted to occupy empty scavenged mollusc shells to protect their fragile exoskeletons.|Wow, you sound so smart!|Thanks, but now I'm really worried about my fragile exoskeleton. I don't have anything to protect it.|Let's go scavenge some empty mollusc shells.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think this mud is just lots and lots of crushed up bugs?|I'd say that at least some of it is.|So really this mud is just a delicious bug smoothie?|Well, no, not really.|Then why does it taste like a delicious bug smoothie?|I... don't know.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've decided to become a five dimensional being.|Oh. Uh... cool?|I want to eat time and space.|Maybe you just need a sandwich?|I want to exist everywhere and nowhere, all at once.|I'm going to make you a sandwich.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, what's the difference between snow, sleet and hail?|Snow is snow. Hail is like... angry snow. Sleet is like hail but it is lazy and half committed.|I don't think I understand...|Sleet needs to get a job and start paying its own way.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"Pigs are very intelligent!|That's true, they can even be trained like dogs.|One time I saw a pig driving a car.|Wow! You did?|Yes, and he was using his cell phone to write an email at the same time.|Hmm, using a phone while driving... I take back what I said about pigs being intelligent.|But the email was about quantum physics!|Wait, how could you read his email?|I have very good eyesight.|Sure.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Shipwrecks are neat. If I had a ship I think I would wreck it on purpose.|If I had a ship, I'd wreck it on accident!|You would?|Yeah, I've got no hands and no idea what I'm doing.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think these caves could collapse?|Anything's possible if you follow your dreams.|It's not my dream!|If you believe it you can achieve it.|I don't want to achieve it!|You can do anything you set your mind to!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy World Mosquito Day, Dad!|My favorite holiday! Hooray for Mosquitos!|Uh, I think World Mosquito Day is in commemoration of the discovery that mosquitos spread malaria.|Well, Mosquitos are an important part of that.|Yes, but not the good part.|Congratulations Mosquitos! We couldn't have done it without you!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Is it called a desert because it's deserted?|Yeah, I think so.|But... if we are here, it's not deserted. Which means it's not really a desert is it?|I guess not!|What is it then?|What's the opposite of a desert?|A mall?|Yeah, I guess we are at the mall.|Cool!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I think that this might be an intergalactic trash barge.|Why do you think that?|Because you're on it, hahaha!|So are you.|Oh, right.|Also, you're grounded.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think we will see a snow leopard?|It will probably see us way before we see it.|Oh no!|Yeah it could be watching us right now, getting ready to pounce.|I knew I shouldn't have filled my pockets with catnip before I left home.|You have pockets?!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, read any good books lately?|Nope, only really terrible ones. Last one I read was The History Of Farts, by Gramanda Borkingson. It was gross and not very informative.|Ew.|Before that I read The Secret Truth About Dogs, by Bernard Flounder-Raisin. It makes the case that dogs are actually just small horses. I found it inaccurate and unconvincing.|Are you deliberately choosing awful books to read?|No, but maybe I should stop reading books that I find in trash cans.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"People say pigeons are rats with wings, but I saw a rat with wings once and it didn't look anything like a pigeon.|Where did you see that?|In the alleyway between the burger place and the toxic waste dump. There's heaps of cool stuff there. One time I saw a dog with tentacles!|Neat!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm looking for mutants!|Found any yet?|Not really, but if you think about it, the real mutants were the friends we made along the way.|That doesn't make any sense.|A stranger is just a mutant you haven't met yet.|Huh?|A mutant in the hand is worth two in the bush.|I have no idea what you are talking about.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Vines are cool, they are like very lazy snakes.|Maybe snakes are like very active vines?|They are both just weird spaghetti.|Good point.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I invested all my money in crypt-currency!|You mean crypto currency? I don't think that's a great idea.|No! CRYPT-currency. I threw my wallet into a crypt!|Have you... seen any return on this investment?|No, but I'm too scared to go get it out again. There's really big spiders in there!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, how often do you go to the dentist?|Once every few months, why?|Do you think it's a scam?|No way, dental care is very important.|Yeah but do you actually have teeth?|I... think so?|Have you ever seen them?|...no...|...|It IS a scam!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy holidays, Dad!|It's a holiday?|Uh, sure, why not.|What holiday is it?|Umm. It's \"parents give your kids some money day\". It's a new one.|Sounds legit.|Can I have twenty bucks?|No.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"So thirsty. Water, water everywhere, but not a drop to drink.|I've got some drinking water if you'd like some?|What flavor?|Water... flavor.|Sparkling?|Still.|Hmm, nah I'm good.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I bet this place used to be a busy place of worship for the forgotten gods of an ancient civilization!|I bet!|Or maybe just a public toilet for an ancient civilisation!|Could be, I guess?");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"If I was a criminal I'd definitely hang out down by the docks.|Because of all the unsavoury types that gather around these parts, and all the opportunities to commit crimes unnoticed?|No, I just like it here. The water is calming and I find all the big machinery really interesting.|Fair enough, but what has that got to do with being a criminal?|Criminals like to relax too, Dad.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey, man. You know, I'm always glad to see you. You're such a good listener.|*SCREEEECH*|...and you always know the right thing to say!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Stalactites have to hold on TIGHT to the ceiling, stalagmites MIGHT grow to meet them!|That's a handy way to remember which is which.|Yes, it's very useful for all those situations where I need to remember the difference between stalactites and stalagmites.|Yeah, that must come up all the time.|All the time, yes.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, do you like my haircut?|...um, yes?|You didn't even notice, did you?|I can't say I did, sorry. But now that you mention it, I think you look great!|Thanks! I'm going for a whole new style!|Uh, yeah, I can tell... totally.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, want this big bag of skulls I found?|No. No, I do not want the big bag of skulls you found.  You need to put it back. Where did you find it?|The secret graveyard in the basement of the post office.|The what?!|The secret graveyard in the basement of the post office!|I think we should probably steer clear of the post office from now on.|But my stamps!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Tide goes in, tide goes out. Like hams in the hourglass, these are the days of our times.|You are a true poet.|Thanks Dad!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's time to get organized, Dad!|In what way?|Its time declutter your life. We are going to throw away all the things that don't bring you joy.|I don't really own any things.|Nothing at all?|Uh, I have some eggs.|Do they bring you joy?|They are for my lunch. So... yes.|Well it sounds like our work here is done. Good job decluttering, Dad!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, do you prefer snowboarding or waterboarding?|Uh... snowboarding. Waterboarding is a form of torture.|It is?! It sounds like a fun summertime sport.|It does, but it's not. It's awful.|I guess I'm going to cancel that waterboarding trip with the fellas then.|Yeah, that's probably a good call.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, let's go deep-sea diving!|Why don't you go, and I'll wait here.|But you'll miss out on all the wonders of the ocean floor!|I'll just stay here and use my imagination.|Aw man.|Ooh a barracuda! Oh, wow a sea turtle!|Stop it.|Wow, a sea cucumber! Oh no, a shark!|Dad!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, what three words best describe you?|Radish... dad.|That's only two, you need a third.|Oh, umm... \"otters\".|Otters!?|Sorry, this is hard. I feel like I'm more of a two word guy.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hate playgrounds.|Why?|Swings are just wiggly seats. Slides are just slippery seats. Sandpits are just dirty seats.|I guess so.|It's all just a series of seats to sit on.|Is that so bad?|I hate seats.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, can we go to that disgusting filthy restaurant?|Which one?|You know, the one with the rats?|Oh, yep maybe, why?|I just love the atmosphere.|And the rats?|I come for the atmosphere, but I stay for the wildlife.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I want to eat a crab, but they keep running away.|Put a sign on your forehead that says \"Crab Disco\" and lie down with your mouth open. Eventually they'll come to you.|You're a genius! Thanks Dad!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I need to send a fax to head office!|Fax? What is this, 1992? Don't they have email?|They only have fax and pneumatic tube.|Carrier pigeon? Smoke signals?|Nope.|It might just be easier to quit.|OK, I'll do that.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, do you think we should start going to the gym?|I think I get enough exercise chasing after you kids.|Yeah but you don't get to say cool things like \"rise and grind\" and \"no agony no brag-ony\".|I'm totally OK with that.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"I've decided to join a gang of wild goats and do goat crimes.|What are goat crimes?|They are just like regular crimes, except you are a goat.|So you're just going to become a criminal?|No, a GOAT criminal.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think there's any cavemen down here?|I don't think cavemen have existed for thousands of years.|Are you sure? Did you check ALL the caves?|Not... all of them...|I bet there are cavemen down here! CAVEMEN, WHERE ARE YOUUU?|Shh!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I like lurking around in the sewers like a mutant!|You do?|Prowling in the darkness, looking for rats to munch, hehehe.|I think you might have been down here for too long.|I only got here half an hour ago. I just really like munching rats.|Oh, well OK then.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I should have brought enough snacks to share with the ancient demons and crystal skulls.|Oh well, you'll bring more next time.|Yeah, I shouldn't have given them all away to the goblins.|There are... goblins?!|There's one right behind you!|AHH!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, what would you do if you had 10 million dollars?|I'd probably invest it.|BOOORING!|Oh, uh, I mean... I'd invest it... in my family... by buying them all jet skis?|That's better!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I don't think I ever want to fly on an aeroplane. It's too scary.|You're scared the plane will crash?|No, I'm scared that I'll have an allergic reaction to the airline food.|But you don't have any allergies?|Not that I know of, but that would be an awful time to find out. Also, what if the plane explodes in mid air?|Good point.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Congratulations, Dad! You won the competition!|What competition?|The world's best Dad competition!|Oh wow, thank you so much!|You were the only one who entered.|I didn't enter.|Oh, in that case you're disqualified. Please give me back the prize money.|You didn't give me any prize money!|GIVE ME TWENTY DOLLARS!|No!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, do you think I'm annoying?|A little bit, in an adorable kind of way.|What if I do this...|What?|BEEPBEEPBEEPBEEPBEEPBEEPBEEP.|Ahh!|NEENORNEENORNEENORNEENORNEENOR.|Stop it!|Annoying, right?|Yes!|Awesome!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, do you think this forest will one day be razed for farm land, ultimately contributing to the growing global ecological disaster?|Nah, I don't think so.|How come?|Because this is a video game. This forest isn't even real.|Oh, thank goodness!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, if we are vegetables, how come we can talk and walk around?|I'm not sure. Maybe we evolved over millions of years as a natural response to our environment.|Or maybe someone dropped us in some toxic waste?|Maybe, or maybe we were bitten by a radioactive... person?|Either way, we are horrible abominations, right Dad?|Not me, I'm beautiful.|If you say so.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I love this music!|Wait... you can hear it too?|Yeah, it sounds like the soundtrack to a videogame.|That is such a relief. I was certain it was just in my head. I thought I was going nuts.|And you've just been keeping that to yourself?!|Yeah...|You need to talk about these things, Dad!|I like the music though... and I was worried it would go away if I got help.|Dad!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, did you know that some cactuses only bloom at night?|Just like me.|What does that mean?|I don't know but it sounded deep.|Did it?");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place could do with a lick of paint, and maybe some flowers.|Maybe an exorcism.|Oh yeah that too. And curtains! Cute ones with little bunnies on them.|Sounds great.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, can we go for a ride on a train? It's my dying wish.|What?! You're dying?|No?|Then why did you say \"dying wish\"?|Because I'm just dying to go for a ride on the train..?|THAT'S NOT WHAT THAT MEANS.|So no train then?");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Space is the place... for healthy eating and staying hydrated.|Shouldn't most places be the place for healthy eating and staying hydrated?|Nope, just space. Everywhere else is the place for spaghetti.|OK, got it!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"You'd think there'd be more animals around here.|Maybe they saw you coming and they hid.|Why would they do that?|Because you're an apex predator.|I'm a tiny radish child.|A tiny radish child... with deadly claws!|I don't have deadly claws!|Yeah, but they don't know that.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This is a terrible place for a jousting competition.|There's no jousting competition down here?|Yeah, and that's a good thing too. It'd be a disaster.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, did you get my postcard?|No sorry, I think it might have got lost in the mail. What did it say?|\"WISH YOU WERE HERE\" and it had a picture of a cow.|You wish I was near... a cow?|Yes.|Well, I do love cows.|Cows are awesome!|Thanks for the postcard, buddy.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, I'm writing a book about all my adventures!|Cool! How's that going?|Good, I'm just up to the part where I defeated Lord Durnak.|But that was me!|Oh yeah, I didn't have enough adventures so I had to borrow some of yours.|I don't know, man...|I also borrowed your credit card to pay to get the book printed.|What?! You're so grounded.|But I'll give you a signed copy!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I parked my car around here somewhere, but now I can't find it.|You parked your car in a swamp?!|Yeah, then I turned around for a minute and when I looked back it was gone!|Do you think it might have sunk?|Nah, I put the handbrake on.|Hmm.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"There's too much nature here, please fix it Dad.|What would you like me to do?|Push it down.|I don't think I'm strong enough to do that.|Call the police.|I don't think they will help.|Write a letter to the government.|How about we just go home instead?|OK, that works.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad this place is awful!|What's wrong?|I have so many emails, and so many meetings! And most of the meetings should have been emails!|That sounds about right.|Also this place is full of deadly spike traps!|Ah, yes, the joys of working for a large corporation.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm a rugged mountain man!|Really? How so?|I cut down trees, I hunt deer and I write poetry.|Poetry?|There's nothing more rugged than being in touch with your feelings, Dad.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Nature is amazing! All the plants and animals! It's mind blowing when you think about it.|It sure is, buddy.|Are we part of nature too, Dad?|I don't think there's anything natural about a talking radish, son.|Oh.|Freaks of nature, maybe.|Oh no.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, if I buy enough postage stamps can I post myself somewhere?|Not legally.|You're not saying no, though.|Well it IS an extremely cheap way to travel.|Let's go buy some stamps!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I want to get a tattoo of a huge eagle!|Really?|He'll be holding a pitchfork and screaming \"Freedom!\"|Wow.|In the background there will be mountains and on the mountains there will be thousands of sheep and alpaca waving beautiful ribbons! Each ribbon will say \"Congratulations!\" on it. Except for one, which will say \"Happy Birthday\".|This tattoo would have to be enormous, I'm not sure you have room...|I'm planning on gaining lots of weight first! I've been eating whole sticks of butter!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I want to become a fishyman!|I think you mean a fisherman? Someone who catches fish for a living?|No, a fishy man! A suspicious guy! Lurking in the shadows, giggling to myself, that sort of thing.|Oh, well it's good to have goals I guess.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm itchy all over! I think I'm allergic to the grass.|Oh no!|I tried rolling in some mud to cure the itchiness, but I just ended up covered in leeches.|Maybe find some rats to bite the leeches off?|Good idea!");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"I'm a jungle boy! I was raised by wolves!|No you weren't! You were raised by me.|The wolf man!|I'm not a wolf man!|Not with that attitude.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, do you like horror movies?|Nah, my life is too much like a horror movie.|Your life is like an action movie! You're always rescuing your family and doing cool jumps and stuff.|I wish my life was like a period drama.|You do?|Yeah, I like the costumes.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hello! Have you ever written dialogue for a video game before? It sounds like hard work.|*SCREEEECH*|Yeah, totally! Well said.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I'm throwing a theme party!|Cool, what's the theme?|Tuberculosis!|Tuberculosis is pretty serious buddy, I don't know if it's a good theme for a party.|Good thing you're not invited, then!|Hey, no fair!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, have you ever considered collecting coins? I hear if you get 100 coins you get an extra life.|That sounds like video game logic to me, those sorts of things don't work in real life.|Yeah, that's true.|Besides, whenever I die I just wake up at the start of the level again.|Level?! What do you mean?|Uh... I'm not sure.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Wow, this place seems super cursed.|The good kind of curse or the bad kind of curse?|The bad kind!|Oh no!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"How come there's never any good natural disasters, only bad ones?|What do you mean?|It's always, \"lots of people lost their houses due to flooding\", and never \"lots of people's houses filled up with huge gold nuggets while they were out getting groceries and no one was harmed\".|I guess that's just the way it is.|I think we need to take matters into our own hands.|How?|Let's go get a digger and some gold nuggets and I'll explain on the way.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I'm scared of the dark!|Don't worry, no one's seen any night goblins in ages.|NIGHT GOBLINS? WHAT'S A NIGHT GOBLIN?!|Oh, uh, forget I said anything.|DAD!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've got sand in my shoes!|You're not wearing shoes.|I didn't say I was. I just carry around a pair of shoes filled with sand for fun.|Sounds like a laugh.|Oh, it is!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, can you do any tricks?|I can double jump!|BOOORING. Ground pound? Spin dash?|Nope.|Shoot a fireball out of your hands?|No, sorry. I can hard boil an egg?|That doesn't count as a trick.|I'm really good at it though!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"FOOD FIGHT!!!|I think after you yell that, you're supposed to throw some food at someone.|That sounds wasteful. I just like the yelling part.|Good boy.|I love to yell!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's crazy how many balloons are just laying around.|I guess a lot of people have parties and forget to pick them up afterwards.|Maybe we should put up signs that say \"TAKE YOUR BALLOONS HOME WITH YOU\".|That might work!|\"TAKE YOUR BALLOONS HOME WITH YOU OR MY DAD WILL SHOOT YOU WITH A HARPOON\".|That might be going too far.|It's just to scare them, you don't have to actually do it!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, are you proud of me?|Of course, and I'll always be proud of you kids. I love you no matter what.|Even if, for example, I stole a swan from the park, dressed it up in a little suit and a gorilla mask and let it loose in the mall?|I'd still be proud of you, but I might also be a little confused and afraid of you.|Good to know, I'll keep that in mind!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's so sunny here, I could just lay down on the sand and go to sleep.|Be careful, it's so hot you might cook!|I don't care, I'll be delicious.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, you should read this book, it changed my life!|What's it called?|THE TRICK: VISUALIZE AND MANIFEST YOUR DREAMS IN 10 EASY STEPS.|Isn't that one of those positive thinking scams?|No it works, it's how I got my solid gold car!|You don't have a solid gold car.|I will soon if I just keep visualizing it.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, it's my birthday! You know what that means?|What?|ALL CRIMES ARE LEGAL FOR 24 HOURS!|Uh, I'm not sure about that.|No, it's true! That's what birthdays are for!|I don't think so.|I'm going to go steal a policeman's hat!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Boo!|Eeek!|Happy Halloween, Dad! Did I scare you?|I'm always a little bit scared of you.|Hooray!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm making a time capsule!|What are you putting in it?|Just trash.|Just trash?!|Trash and farts.|Trash and farts!?|Haha yeah, people in the year 4000 are in for a shock!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place would be way more fun if we had jet skis.|Most places would be fun if we had jet skis.|The bank?|Definitely! The doctors office?|Totally! The duck pond?|Absolutely!|Let's get jet skis, Dad!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, do you believe in ghosts?|No, but I'm still scared of them, just in case.|Me too... I hope they aren't offended by us not believing in them.|Let's go home before they hear us.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, do you think time travel is possible?|If it was, don't you think we'd already know?|How do you mean?|Well, wouldn't someone from the future travel back and tell us about it?|Maybe they don't want to.|Why not?|Maybe the future is too awesome and they are all having too much fun to travel back in time.|You know, I really hope you're right.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've come up with a new sport! It's a sequel to tennis. I call it elevennis!|How would it be different?|Instead of one ball, there's five!|Interesting.|And the balls are on fire!|I like it.|And instead of using rackets, you use guns!|Do you shoot the ball? Or hit it with the gun?|Both!|That sounds awesome!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This place is a peaceful meadow now, but two hundred years ago an epic battle took place here.|Really?|I have no idea. Maybe!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"What is your favorite football team?|The Kitchen Island Buffaroos.|That's not a real team, is it?|No, I don't actually know anything about sports.|Me neither.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think some of these containers are fake, to throw us off the scent?|Off the scent of what?|The real containers! Are you even paying attention?|What's in the real containers?|Well, we won't know that until we find them, will we!|OK... then.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, were you a kid once?|Yep, a long time ago.|In the time of dinosaurs?|Um, maybe not that long ago.|Back when everything was in black and white?|No, not that I remember.|You probably just don't remember because you're so old!|I'm only thirty five!|Yeah, thirty five thousand!|Hey!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Mushrooms are great. Some of them taste like a nice steak. Other ones kill you!|That sounds dangerous and confusing to me.|It's exciting! You roll the dice every time you take a bite!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, I'm the best!|The best at what?|I'm the best there is! Nothing can stop me!|I admire the confidence... but where's this coming from?|I'm better than everybody else!|OK, that might be too much confidence, tone it down a bit.|I'm... only average! I'm... not the worst!|Much better.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm going to take up surfing!|Cool! Good luck.|I'm going to learn to do a kickflip!|I think that's skateboarding, not surfing.|I don't care, I'm going to do a kickflip over a shark!|I'm proud of you, son.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I lost my job, Dad.|What happened?|I showed up for work one day and it was just gone.|What?|Yeah, the whole building had disappeared.|That's crazy!|I asked an old man what happened, and he said there hadn't been a building there since the last one burned down 50 years ago.|What?! Do you think you'd been working for ghosts this whole time?|Maybe! They were dressed weird and they did say boo a lot. Also my boss was a skeleton.|Spooky!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm so sick of these leaves blowing everywhere, why can't they just calm down?|Yeah, just relax, leaves.|Take a load off, leaves!|Put your feet up, leaves!|Chill out, leaves!|We sure told them!|They are still blowing everywhere though...|Oh well.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Good news, Dad! I've cured all diseases!|That's fantastic news!|It turns out you just need to drink gallons and gallons of essential oils every week.|Uh...|I feel absolutely terrible, but as far as I can tell, I have no diseases!|How many diseases did you have before?|None, but I had a very itchy leg.|You don't have a leg.|See, it works!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, you should run for mayor!|Mayor of what? We live in the wilderness.|Mayor of the wilderness! There probably isn't much competition.|Maybe a bear or wolf.|Yeah, but no ones going to vote for them.|The competition might eat me though.|They can't eat the mayor, that's regicide!|That's only if you kill a king, I think.|Oh... herbicide?|Haha, maybe.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Life sure is crazy sometimes. I never even thought I'd get to BE a dad, and now look at me!|*SCREEEECH*|Haha, definitely. I wouldn't change it for the world though.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Maybe we should try wearing jackets.|Do you know how many brothers and sisters you have?|Uh, no? Maybe... three hundred and sixty something?|Yeah, I can't afford that many jackets.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think there's any crocodiles around here?|No, I don't think so.|Why not?|They are probably busy doing crocodile stuff elsewhere.|Like what?|Crocodile shopping, going to the crocodile cinema, casting their crocodile votes in the crocodile election.|I never knew crocodiles lived such varied and interesting lives.|You learn something new every day.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hope we don't run into any mole-people.|Or moles.|Or people!|Yeah, they are the worst.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I like it down here, it almost never rains.|That is technically true, yes.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I've been going to job interviews for fun!|For fun?|Yeah, I do really well in the interview and then they try to hire me, but I say \"NO! I don't want your crummy office job, you smelly old loony\". It's hilarious.|That's crazy.|They even offer me more money sometimes! I just laugh in their faces!|You're a maniac. I'm proud of you.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, can we get a dog?|What sort of dog?|A HUGE FLUFFY ONE! As big as a house!|That's pretty big!|Yeah but that's OK, we can use it for shelter. When it's cold and windy outside we can cuddle up to our giant dog.|Do you actually want a dog or are you just cold?|I'm... not sure.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"There are ancient demons in the walls!|That's a worry.|They are saying \"Help! We are stuck in the walls! We went in here looking for cool bugs and we got stuck!\". Do you think we should let them out?|Hmm... nah.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think there's a torture chamber in this place?|I think it's all torture chambers. Torture chambers from top to bottom.|That does explain the... uh... everything.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think we should be worried about breathing in toxic mould?|I mean, yeah, but no more than all the other stuff that's trying to kill us.|Like Knifey The Sewerman?|Who?!|Oh, uh... you don't want to know.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, I need those spreadsheets on my desk by five!|I don't work here! Also, don't boss me around.|But I'm the boss!|Well you're fired!|You can't fire me, I quit!|OK!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Have you ever met anyone famous?|Yes! I met Bloral Flurk at a the park once. He was really nice.|Who?|Bloral Flurk. The tap dancing film star and war hero.|I don't think that's a real person, Dad.|Really? Then who did I meet?|Maybe it was just some random guy?|Now that I think about it, he did seem quite frightened.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hi Dad, I'm a time traveler from the year 3000!|If you're a time traveler, then how come you called me Dad?|Uh... we call everyone \"Dad\" in the year 3000, it's a term of endearment...|Wow, the future sounds weird.|It really is.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hate the feeling of sand between my toes.|I've got good news for you, buddy.|I don't have toes?|That's right.|Then what's this horrible feeling?|It might be anxiety.|Aw man. I wish I had toes.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think turtles know how cool they are?|No, I don't think they are aware.|Me neither. That's what makes them so cool!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you think if we go deep enough into these caves we'll come out on the other side of the planet?|We'd have to pass through the earth's molten core first. Might be a bit hot.|Yay, molten core! Let's go!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, can we get a 3D printer?|What do you want to print?|I'll print a second 3D printer! Then we can return the first one to the store.|That's just crazy enough to work.|Then we can 3D print some pizzas for dinner!|Genius!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, did you know that trees communicate with each other using their roots!|That's pretty cool.|It's kind of like the internet!|I suppose so!|They are probably sending each other some memes right now, maybe some cat videos.|Nature truly is amazing.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, did you know that there's free food inside trash cans? People just leave it there!|Uh, that food's probably been thrown out for a reason.|Yeah probably because it's too delicious!|I don't think that's the reason.|I'm never paying for food again!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I'm the king of the castle and you're a dirty moron!|That's not how the rhyme goes!|What rhyme?");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I saw a submarine!|Where?|Just over there! It was a small submarine with scales and fins.|That was a fish.|A fish is a type of submarine!|No it isn't!|Yes it is, a fish is a submarine for parasites!|Gross.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Hey Dad, do you want to build a snowman?|Sure, why not!|Well, maybe because a polar bear might mistake our snowman for an attractive lady polar bear and then come over here and eat us?|I meant that rhetorically, but good point. Let's go home.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This water tasted weird at first, but now I'm starting to like it.|This is waste water, I don't think you should be drinking it.|But the more I drink the more powerful I become!|Powerful?|The water gives me cool powers!|Like what?|It gave me the power to vomit a whole bunch! I couldn't stop!|Let's go home.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Ah, the smell of this place reminds me of home.|It smells terrible!|Yeah, you need to clean up around home more often, Dad.|You could help once in a while.|Haha nope!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I hope I don't get washed away in a flood.|Me too!|Or crushed in a landslide.|That would be bad!|Or chased into a tree by a pack of angry piglets, only for the tree to fall down into a river and get washed out to sea.|That's very specific.|I've got to stop bothering piglets.|Good idea.");_fZ1(global._NK3,
"This place gives me the creeps. I hope there aren't any ghosts around.|Don't worry, ghosts aren't real. There's probably just a bunch of bats and spiders.|Wait... bats are real?!|Of course!|I thought they were just made up for Halloween, like vampires and goths.|Goths are real too.|Now you're just messing with me.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Do you ever just scratch your head and think about life sometimes?|*SCREEEECH*|Yeah, me too, man. Me too.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"If I had a shipping container, I would use it to make a giant lasagne.|Really?|Yeah! I'd fill it from top to bottom with delicious lasagne.|Awesome!|Then I'd ship it to a really hungry guy in a country where they don't have lasagne, like Wales.|That's very kind of you.|Thanks!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad... what if one of these shipping containers contains a cursed amulet stolen from an ancient tomb?|That's a bridge we will cross when we come to it.|I think we should push all the containers into the sea just to be safe.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Mmm... mud, nature's chocolate.|I don't think you should eat mud.|But it comes from nature, so it must be healthy!|Wasps come from nature.|Mmm... wasps.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's beautiful here this time of year.|It's a sewer. It looks the same all year round.|It looks beautiful all year round.|It looks disgusting!|Not if you're a sewer rat.|I'm not a sewer rat!|Not with that attitude.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Dad, the wasps are coming for me!|Did you do something to upset them?|I wrote a pretty scathing article about them for an online newspaper.|Oh no!|It was titled \"Wasps: like bees, but awful\".|Oh no!|Also I set fire to a bunch of wasp nests.|Yeah, you're on your own with this one.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This isn't a very good vacation spot, Dad.|This isn't a vacation.|I know, I'm just saying in case you think of bringing us back here on vacation later on.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"This looks like a nice place to take a nap.|That's what I said... right before I was EATEN BY WOLVES!|But you weren't eaten by wolves, you're right here.|I still think the moral of the story rings true.|What moral?!|Don't... uh... get eaten by wolves.|Good job, Dad.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"You're fired, Dad!|I don't work here. I quit two years ago.|Well that explains why you've been underperforming. You've been really letting the rest of the team down.|I'm not part of the team!|That sort of attitude is exactly the reason that we are letting you go.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Elephants have no business being so cool!|They don't?|No! With their cool trunks and their cool ears.|They are pretty cool!|And their cool sunglasses.|Sunglasses?!|and their backwards hats.|Hats?!|Always hanging out in the VIP lounge.|I don't think elephants do that.|Pff, you don't know anything about elephants, Dad.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"Happy birthday, Dad!|Thanks, pal!|How old are you today?|I'm 35.|I feel like you were 35 last year, too...|I've actually been 35 for a few years now.|How does that work?|It's a mystery!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It's Christmas tomorrow, Dad! I'm so excited!|Because Santa's going to bring you a present?|No! Because I'm going to eat my weight in trifle!|Save some for me?|NO!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Merry Christmas, Dad!|Merry Christmas, bud.|Did you get any good gifts?|Yep, the best gift of all! I got to spend time with my family! My stupid, stupid family.|But you get to do that every day?|I know. I'm the luckiest guy in the world.|I love you Dad.|I love you too.");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"If I lived in the jungle I'd become an accountant.|An accountant?|A jungle accountant, yes.|Why?|Well, do you see any other accountants around here?|No...|Exactly! I'd have the market cornered.|You are truly a savvy businesswoman.|Thanks!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Swamps are great!|They are?|Sure! Got something you don't like? Chuck it in the swamp!|I don't think you should do that.|Homework? Chuck it in the swamp! Tax return? Chuck it in the swamp! Gruyere? Chuck it in the swamp!|I like gruyere!|I'll chuck you in the swamp!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"I love crunching leaves!|Me too.|But I live in fear that one day they will have their revenge.|Revenge?!|Yeah, one day a big leaf might come and crunch me. That's why I sleep with one eye open.|Oh no!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"It sure is lonely up here in space.|You're not alone!|All alone, just me and the vast nothingness.|I'm here!|Just me and my thoughts, forever and ever.");_fZ1(global._NK3,"I found a website that tells you what your sewer-name would be!|Neat!|Mine's \"Fangy Rat Lord\"!|Cool! What's mine?|Let's see... \"Bitey McPoison\"!|Nice!");
_fZ1(global._NK3,"The year is almost over, Dad!|You know, despite, well, everything, I've had a really good year.|Can we do a countdown yet?|No, it's not time!|I don't care, I want to count down! 5, 4, 3, 2, 1...|Not yet!");_fZ1(global._NK3,"Today's a special day, Dad! It's leap year day! It only happens every four years!|What do we do? I feel like we need to do something.|Let's drive a car into the sea!|That's not really what I had in mind.|No one can stop us, it's leap year day!|Oh, alright then.");
